@startuml sequence-auth
title 【シーケンス図】認証

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999

actor Client

' ============================================================
' ログイン
' ============================================================
== ログイン (POST /api/login) ==

Client -> AuthController : POST /api/login\n{emailAddress, password}

note over AuthController
  JWTフィルターは /api/login には適用されない
  （Spring Securityの認証パスとして除外）
end note

AuthController -> AuthenticationManager : authenticate(\n  UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken\n)

AuthenticationManager -> CustomUserDetailsService : loadUserByUsername(email)
CustomUserDetailsService -> UserRepository : findUserByEmailAddress(email)
UserRepository --> CustomUserDetailsService : User
CustomUserDetailsService --> AuthenticationManager : UserDetails

note over AuthenticationManager
  パスワード照合（BCrypt）
end note

AuthenticationManager --> AuthController : Authentication（成功）

AuthController -> UserApplicationService : updateUserLoginHistory(command)
  UserApplicationService -> UserRepository : findUserByEmailAddress(email)
  UserRepository --> UserApplicationService : User
  UserApplicationService -> UserLoginHistoryRepository : findUserLoginHistoryByUserId(userId)
  UserLoginHistoryRepository --> UserApplicationService : Optional<UserLoginHistory>

  alt 初回ログイン（レコードなし）
    UserApplicationService -> UserLoginHistoryRepository : save(UserLoginHistory.create(userId))
  else 2回目以降（レコードあり）
    UserApplicationService -> UserLoginHistoryRepository : save(history.update())
  end

AuthController -> JwtUtil : generateJwtToken(email)
JwtUtil --> AuthController : jwtToken
AuthController -> JwtUtil : generateRefreshToken(email)
JwtUtil --> AuthController : refreshToken

AuthController -> Client : 200 OK\nSet-Cookie: jwt=...; refreshToken=...

' ============================================================
' ログアウト
' ============================================================
== ログアウト (POST /api/logout) ==

Client -> AuthController : POST /api/logout\n(Cookie: jwt, refreshToken)

AuthController -> JwtUtil : clearJwtAndRefreshToken(response)
note right: Cookieの有効期限を0にして削除

AuthController --> Client : 200 OK\nSet-Cookie: jwt=（削除）; refreshToken=（削除）

' ============================================================
' トークンリフレッシュ
' ============================================================
== トークンリフレッシュ (GET /api/auth/refresh) ==

note over Client
  JWTの有効期限切れ時に呼び出す。
  リフレッシュトークンが有効であれば新しいJWT・リフレッシュトークンを取得できる。
end note

Client -> JwtFilter : GET /api/auth/refresh\n(Cookie: jwt=期限切れ, refreshToken=有効)

JwtFilter -> JwtUtil : getJwtFromRequestHeader(request)
JwtUtil --> JwtFilter : jwt（期限切れ）

JwtFilter -> JwtUtil : isTokenExpired(jwt) → true

JwtFilter -> JwtUtil : getRefreshTokenFromCookie(request)
JwtUtil --> JwtFilter : refreshToken

JwtFilter -> JwtUtil : isTokenFormatValid(refreshToken) → true
JwtFilter -> JwtUtil : isTokenExpired(refreshToken) → false

JwtFilter -> CustomUserDetailsService : loadUserById(userId)
CustomUserDetailsService --> JwtFilter : UserDetails

JwtFilter -> JwtUtil : generateJwtToken(userId) → newJwt
JwtFilter -> JwtUtil : generateRefreshToken(userId) → newRefreshToken
JwtFilter -> JwtUtil : setJwtTokenToResponseCookie(response, newJwt)
JwtFilter -> JwtUtil : setRefreshTokenToResponseCookie(response, newRefreshToken)
JwtFilter -> JwtUtil : setTokenToSecurityContext(request, userDetails)

JwtFilter -> AuthController : フィルター通過

AuthController --> Client : 200 OK\nSet-Cookie: jwt=新JWT; refreshToken=新RefreshToken

@enduml
